          "type": "text",
          "text": "Rescue planners noted uneven terrain across the site while preparing a replacement frame. A rectangular section of the school robotics platform measures 24 m by 32 m. A cable runs straight from one corner to the opposite corner. Find the cable length in metres. Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 3,
      "primary_outcome": "4.1",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
